/-
Exact seven-anchor correlation window through `w = 17/18`.

The strengthened head uses seven adjacent edges against the first seven
diagonal coordinates.  The unused `c_7^2` starts a symbolic PF2 tail from
the exact ratio `c_7/c_6 = (8/7)w^15`.
-/

